Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our turn! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If any of those pirates tries to\Nset foot on these grounds tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be the last thing they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The honor of Galilee law depends on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the back door covered?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got guys covering the entire\Nperimeter of this place and then some!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's getting in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all huge and armed and angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys have a\Nreputation for being able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to handle themselves\Nwhen push comes to shove.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to rush in and do\Nanything we're going to regret later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if we try to barge in swinging,\Nwe'll just be asking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we wouldn't want any trouble, says\Nthe guy who charged in in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't take your\Neyes off him, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want any kind of\Nsurprise down there. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything happens, you let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're going to have a\Nreally long night ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we blow our opportunity, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let our guard down\Nno matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want to know the truth about Robin,\Nthen it has to be tonight or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got a feeling we'll\Nbe talking to her real soon.
