Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.72,0:03:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalifa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Iceberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to be rude, but do you mind\Nstepping out of the room for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fetch Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to have a word with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Polly. Huh? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg needs to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume it's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some things to take care of\Nin my office if anyone needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like awfully strange timing\Nfor a one-on-one conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in blazes could it be about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his will!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on in there and talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we can step away from the\Ndoor if you're concerned about privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck could he want\Nto talk about with Polly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got enough to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we need to stay\Nfocused on our pirate problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, according to Kalifa, it's a small\Ngroup with only seven people on their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who wants to watch out for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, Pirate\NHunter Zoro, and Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't underestimate the\Ngirl traveling along with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or that other guy with\Nthe long, round nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:04:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are those two you just\Nmentioned, along with two others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what\Nthose pirates are after.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They set foot on this property\Ntonight, they're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single last one of them. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for putting you in\Nharm's way like this, Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is a very grave matter,\Nand I trust you can get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I put my faith in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give you my word, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, suppose I should\Nget on it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta head out and take care of something.\NCool? No problem. That'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The four of us will keep\Nwatch over things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep Iceberg's safe, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.44,0:06:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you leave here, go straight\Nto my office and move my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to lift up the\Nrug and look underneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a safe hidden there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you find that,\Nenter this combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, right to number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you ready yes awaiting\Nyour signal it will be very
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon now at that time the four\Nof you are to carry out your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,respective missions with ruthless\Nefficiency as a loyal member
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Cape you have my word nico\Nrobin are you ready yes i am
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something blew up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab water now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a man down over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure that fire doesn't\Nspread to the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, they're shooting at us! No, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it was some kind of bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must have said it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta put out this fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too subtle, but it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fire's in the north\Ncorner of the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has anyone heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There have been no pirates spotted yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone keep your eyes\Npeeled for intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:07:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay at your posts, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just a bit shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.04,0:08:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that guy in the costume! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All pounding their faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he goes! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got this clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Locks him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's heading for the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you thought you could\Nget away, didn't you, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take a lot more\Nthan that to get by us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made a big mistake when you\Ndecided to mess with Galley-La?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the beating of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna show any mercy, scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can come at me with all\Nyou've got, but it still won't be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,floor plan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,memorized is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all seem pretty worked up down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:09:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's definitely something\Ngoing on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are we going to make our move?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Luffy? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we weren't going\Nto rush into anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we weren't going\Nto rush into anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, they can't get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of nerve coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the crap you tried\Nto pull last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are in for a world of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For messing with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg Surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we might just go easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We already know it's not just the two\Nof you guys and your little pirate gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pulling out a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! They're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that guy's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He flew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was flying through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not know when to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thorny Road!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you you were bested, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready! Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna land in the courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get around him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can trap him in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time, it was literally\Nright under our noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly\Nunderstand its importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you bastards?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the hell did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, from the darkest\Ncorners of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bring with us the light of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are Cipher pole number nine,\Nan undercover intelligence agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter where\Nyou freaks came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure as hell didn't get in without\Nrunning into the galley log craftsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The details are all very hazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sea of fists and bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's important is we're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't just some\Nassassination plot, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very astute but then we never claimed\Nthat it was now did we in any case we
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need what iceberg was trying to keep\Nhidden the item you hold in your trembling
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:14:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hand now and since you've been made aware\Nof its existence we need to take your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.72,0:14:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life as well entrusting you to this task
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,iceberg has signed your Death warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of those guys anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They get inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's men standing guard at\Nevery single point of entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, there's no way they got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got to be hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search the perimeter one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, he's behind this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, give me a push.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd\Nbe coming back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this how you came in last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the power of the Dory fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where a normal man sees a wall,\NI see a prospective entryway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how thick it may be, I\Nsimply touch it and it opens for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not time yet. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a fatal wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll still be able to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just giving him a\Ntaste of what's to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like an appetizer of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll be\Nrunning off anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before we get the signal\Nto finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps I should say, to\Nserve him the main course. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how CP9 handles things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, that is how we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That poor straw, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he had nothing to\Ndo with this, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to beat\Nyourself up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you simply told the\Ntruth exactly as you saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I was indeed here last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was all part of your\Nplan, wasn't it? Right again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive for two reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, so you could tell your\Nstory of the failed assassination,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,placing a member of the Straw Hat\Ncrew at the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secondly, we were trying to\Nferret out an important document.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blueprints of a certain ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that has been passed\Ndown in secret from
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shipwright to chosen\Napprentice for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew that with your\Nlife clearly in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would pass that document on to\Nsomeone you trusted to keep it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made that choice earlier tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your foreman, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.42,0:16:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our associates are with\Nhim this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:17:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all going as planned, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be very damn proud of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to see this to its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll go deal with the\Nriffraff standing guard outside the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the blueprints are secured, our\Nassociates will contact you at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will have full clearance\Nto dispose of iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do so at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure he dies without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, the only remaining\Nloose end will be Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He dies, and the truth of what's\Nhappened here dies with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blame will remain on the Straw\NHats, and no one's the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he doesn't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy, but I thought maybe\Nhe'd listen to his own advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are talking about Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think that's Robin in the middle\Nof all that commotion down at Galley Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.86,0:18:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what Luffy decided to\Ndo, we still gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But him rushing in like that\Nmight actually work in our favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think about the way he does things,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is he the kind of guy that's gonna go\Nin through the back or side entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not his style. No way. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure by now he's made a go at\Nbarging straight through the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's safe to assume that\Nright now he's running around
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside like crazy because he\Nhas no idea where he's going,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.28,0:18:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.49,0:18:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from the shipwright's point of view,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's the leader of the\Ngroup that attacked Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you made it in there by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of those guys are going to\Nbe busy trying to catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which would mean the guards have\Nseverely thinned out at the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or at the very least, they're\Ncompletely distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the safest way in right\Nnow is through the front,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right behind all the\Nchaos in Luffy's wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when he does it,\Nit's completely stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we do the same exact thing,\Nit's actually a brilliant plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say that we should go for it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate is right up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:18:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was a dumb idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to jump right through\Nthe front door like a typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm totally stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm totally stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta get Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need help on the third floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody come to the presence room quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guards are wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.44,0:20:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean wiped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tilestone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kokoro and Lucci should be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.76,0:20:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still no word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired of dealing\Nwith all these idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a noisy one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lay a single finger on Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg, I'll tear you limb from limb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Push that giant hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me! Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those muscles just for show?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this guy stronger than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's taken out three\Nforemen, all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peak Rain Force must not stand! Shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:21:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Roro, Noah, and Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They finally showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.58,0:22:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman is one of them two!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Luffy isn't here, then where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.94,0:22:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they've already found us, so\Nthere's no point in trying to be sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.80,0:22:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing left to do\Nnow is go on the offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running circles around the\Nbuilding won't do us any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.54,0:22:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want to find Robin, then we're\Ngoing to have to force our way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but those are just shipwrights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use the back of my swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight, you get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can still kill people\Nlike that, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.06,0:22:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.32,0:23:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this time, I never\Nthought we'd be meeting here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.42,0:23:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.54,0:23:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night was the first time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.10,0:23:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for a long time,\NI've wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even put your wanted poster up\Nin my room so I'd never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I give you an autograph then?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.64,0:23:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you sign it. In blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.26,0:23:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted to kill me? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.58,0:23:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you destroy the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.96,0:23:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why are you\Nlooking for the Poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must know the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as anyone can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:24:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world government has made it\Na serious crime to research them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.76,0:24:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that knowledge so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're so bad, then\Nwhy do you know about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that the Poneglyphs\Nexist is hardly a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.74,0:24:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But deciphering them is another matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.00,0:24:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're the only person in\Nthe world who's capable of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.86,0:24:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the world government put\Nsuch a large bounty on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.08,0:24:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you were only\Neight years old at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.02,0:24:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fear what you're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.76,0:24:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you alone have the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To revive the ancient weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.70,0:24:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.64,0:24:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have thought\Nthat CP9 was actually real!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.98,0:24:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.12,0:24:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means you've already\Nleft the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.22,0:24:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're helping the\Nworld government now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.84,0:24:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strange choice for a woman who's been\Non their most wanted list for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, well, I suppose\Nthat's not my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.84,0:25:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you decipher the Poneglyphs\Nand rebuild one of the weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.96,0:25:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter if the person\Nwho uses it's good or evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all the same in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A weapon can never be used\Nto bring peace to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.82,0:25:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it can bring is destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.06,0:25:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've buried the evils of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let them lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.20,0:25:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be right, and I don't disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.14,0:25:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't know why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.60,0:25:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to tell me what I'm\Nallowed to do or not do with my research,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.88,0:25:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or what knowledge I can or cannot learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.22,0:25:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I see what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the truth is, we might have\Nmore in common than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.88,0:25:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.82,0:25:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I possess the blueprints for\Nthe ancient weapon known as Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.56,0:25:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they still exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.64,0:25:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pluton is the name of a battleship built\Non this island many years in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.94,0:26:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shipwrights who\Ncreated the weapon passed
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.32,0:26:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the blueprints as a\Nsort of insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.76,0:26:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They feared that another\Nbattleship of equal power would
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be necessary if Pluton ever\Nfell into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.92,0:26:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, the ship was lost to\Nhistory before that could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.86,0:26:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the government wants to\Nrevive that power when
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.48,0:26:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no force strong\Nenough to oppose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A part of me hopes that you didn't know\Nthat when you agreed to help them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that really doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.70,0:26:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man named Tom entrusted\Nthose blueprints to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.12,0:26:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he also told me about\Na young girl who was the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sole survivor of the Ohara\Nincident 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.32,0:26:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said despite her age,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.10,0:26:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was still dangerous because she had\Nthe same ideology as the devils from Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.46,0:26:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In honor of Tom and the other shipwrights,\Nit's my responsibility to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, now that the government\Nknows that the blueprints exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the logical solution would be to\Nburn them and be done with this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.08,0:26:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't do that because\Nas long as you're alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a chance that the\Nweapon could be refilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.10,0:27:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you want\Nto say before you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.20,0:27:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with all due respect, even if you had\Nkilled me, nothing would have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.54,0:27:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government doesn't need me\Nto steal the blueprints from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.28,0:27:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they've already\Naccomplished that anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.60,0:27:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's not get\Nahead of ourselves here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.52,0:27:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who've fallen for my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.62,0:27:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.90,0:28:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get it right this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.54,0:28:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find Robin for sure. Gomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.24,0:28:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.34,0:28:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're no match\Nfor our martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop resisting and hand us the document\Nbefore you soil it with your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.92,0:28:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.92,0:28:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.86,0:28:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.60,0:29:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.98,0:29:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was all my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.58,0:29:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg didn't tell me to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.10,0:29:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.32,0:29:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.54,0:29:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and leave the blueprints behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.56,0:29:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because those are nothing\Nbut fakes. What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.36,0:29:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.20,0:29:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but this\Nmeans your plan's a bust, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.62,0:29:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sucks to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.98,0:29:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The funny thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what you bastards\Nwere looking for in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you've\Noutwitted CP9, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.04,0:29:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're merely delaying the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.52,0:30:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, even though\Nyou're only a decoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.62,0:30:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that you know the truth,\Nwe can't let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.18,0:30:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.18,0:30:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got stuck again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.84,0:30:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid walls always getting in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.94,0:30:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.77,0:30:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this always happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.86,0:30:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.32,0:30:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the rope guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.06,0:30:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.44,0:30:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.92,0:30:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure did surprise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.08,0:30:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.58,0:30:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'm not crashing through walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.36,0:30:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, how kind of you to\Ncome here to take blame for the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.48,0:30:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.74,0:30:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys in the masks\Nmust be the ones that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.52,0:30:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are forcing Robin to\Ndo all this bad stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.68,0:30:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.59,0:30:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You give her back, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.56,0:30:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I wasn't stuck right now, you'd\Nbe in big trouble! Tempest kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.04,0:31:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut right through the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.90,0:31:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.98,0:31:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.12,0:31:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.54,0:31:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.60,0:31:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Restrain Polly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.14,0:31:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's given us enough trouble already.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.60,0:32:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've hit a snag in the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone head to the bedroom immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.46,0:32:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot Iceburg yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.76,0:32:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I absolutely need him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.70,0:32:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has been a delight, but I'm\Nafraid our time is up. You see, I
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.14,0:32:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a pressing matter to attend\Nto running away are you not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.80,0:32:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just finishing you quickly that's all
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.42,0:32:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.50,0:32:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.86,0:32:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.38,0:32:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.92,0:32:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why'd you come here\Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.58,0:32:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone still thinks you're\Nthe ones who attacked Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.14,0:32:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize I might have\Njumped the gun a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.68,0:33:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are pirates, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the point is those weird guys\Nin the masks took one of our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.52,0:33:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're here to get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.34,0:33:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.80,0:33:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're good at fighting, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.02,0:33:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can beat those\Nguys, huh? You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.18,0:33:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.09,0:33:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do this thing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.64,0:33:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm ready to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.10,0:33:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.01,0:33:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.93,0:33:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you think I'm just going to let\Nsome weirdos waltz in out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.40,0:33:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kick my ass, and then kill Iceberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.64,0:33:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.94,0:33:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do these punks think they are anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.22,0:33:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with all this secret agent crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.86,0:33:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg is...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.58,0:33:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more than just my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.80,0:33:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made me a shipwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.42,0:34:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him die! Look\Nat you. You're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.08,0:34:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm ready to fight those\Nbastards, and I'm not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to me,\Nas long as I can save Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.40,0:34:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, but I can't even move\Nbecause I'm stuck to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.84,0:34:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.82,0:34:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.58,0:34:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.86,0:34:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to give you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.74,0:34:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we have a problem! Don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.08,0:35:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does one say to a man\Nwho's marked for death?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First let me be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.30,0:35:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.60,0:35:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.26,0:35:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have handed over the blueprints\Nwhen the government asked nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.42,0:35:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.02,0:35:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.93,0:35:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping we could walk away from\Nthis story without resorting to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.46,0:35:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame you're as\Nhard-headed as your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.40,0:35:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bruno, from the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.72,0:35:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you've been with\Nthe government all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.14,0:35:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:47.50,0:35:52.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,653)\fad(650,650)\blur0.9\bord2.8\fscx160\fscy160\fsp1\c&H050505&\1a&HFF&\t(605,650,\1a&H00&)\t(4230,4275,\1a&HFF&)}The World Government's Covert Intelligence Service\NCipher Pol No. 9
Dialogue: 2,0:35:47.50,0:35:52.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,653)\fad(650,650)\blur0.9\bord0\fscx160\fscy160\fsp1\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}The World Government's Covert Intelligence Service\NCipher Pol No. 9
Dialogue: 3,0:35:47.50,0:35:52.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,653)\fad(650,650)\blur0.9\bord0\fscx160\fscy160\fsp1\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}The World Government's Covert Intelligence Service\NCipher Pol No. 9
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.05,0:35:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, going undercover\Nwas like second nature to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.50,0:35:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, since everyone's being so honest\Nwith each other, let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.78,0:36:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, before someone\Nelse gets hurt, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.16,0:36:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the blueprints for\Nthe ancient weapon Pluton?

